---
source: tools/junius/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Junius management CLI

Usage: junius [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check    Validate manifests against the schema and semantic rules
  sync     Rewrite derived files (`platform/src/generated/plugins.rs` and the `junius managed` regions of `Cargo.toml`s) so they match the deployment config. (Source-tree-only — gated behind the `develop` feature.)
  build    Build a deployment binary
  dev      One-command developer loop. (Source-tree-only — gated behind `develop`.)
  migrate  Apply database migrations and emit per-plugin Postgres role grants
  plugin   Plugin inspection and lifecycle
  cache    Manage the junius source cache (`~/.cache/junius`)
  new      Scaffold new plugins, components, RPC services, migrations, permissions. (Source-tree-only — gated behind the `develop` feature.)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format for command results [default: plain] [possible values: plain, json]
  -v, --verbose...       Increase verbosity (repeat for more)
      --cwd <CWD>        Run as if junius were started in <CWD>
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
